# Category catalog for unifi-blocklist.
#
# Groups and category names mirror the UniFi "CyberSecure Enhanced" content
# filter (UniFi Network 10.6, group mapping taken from the UI bundle), backed by
# free lists instead of the paid Proofpoint/Cloudflare database.
#
# S|<source id>|<url>                         a downloadable list
# C|<group>|<KEY>|<label>|<source ids or ->   a category ("-" = no free list yet)
#
# Sources:  hg_*  HaGeZi  https://github.com/hagezi/dns-blocklists (GPL-3.0)
#           nrd_* HaGeZi NRD  https://github.com/hagezi/nrd
#           ut1_* Université Toulouse 1 blacklists https://dsi.ut-capitole.fr/blacklists (CC BY-SA 4.0),
#                 GitHub mirror https://github.com/olbat/ut1-blacklists
# Sizes in labels are entry counts as of Oct 2026. Lists shared by several categories are downloaded once.

